{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33209","headline":"愤惋诗三首 三 · 刘损","name":"愤惋诗三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧尝游处徧寻看，覩物伤情死一般。\n买笑楼前花已谢，画眉窗下月空残。\n云归巫峡音容断，路隔星河去住难。\n莫道诗成无泪下，泪如泉滴亦须乾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}